132
00:15:56.728 --> 00:15:59.939
With friends like you, who
needs assholes, right, Dan-o?

133
00:16:00.023 --> 00:16:02.108
Calm down. What? You
want to fight Tommy?

134
00:16:02.192 --> 00:16:05.862
Who does he think he is? He's
pissed at you, all right? Is it true?

135
00:16:05.904 --> 00:16:08.698
