comes banging on my door.

137
00:16:10.867 --> 00:16:12.911
Why? Why, Dan?

138
00:16:12.994 --> 00:16:15.038
Listen to yourself.
Dory was Tommy's girl.

139
00:16:15.121 --> 00:16:17.707
