141
00:16:20.418 --> 00:16:22.545
Okay. Yeah, I will.

142
00:16:41.856 --> 00:16:42.899
Hey.

143
00:16:47.612 --> 00:16:49.155
You want these?

144
00:17:03.795 --> 00:17:05.505
You're really cute.

145
00:17:14.681 --> 00:17:15.848
Jesus!

146
00:17:26.109 --> 00:17:27.777
Susie, you okay?

147
00:17:30.655 --> 00:17:31.948
Yeah.

148
00:17:31.990 --> 00:17:33.157
Sorry.

149
00:18:01.269 --> 00:18:02.895
What's the matter?

150
00:18:02.979 --> 00:18:04.647
Couldn't sleep again?

151
00:18:16.492 --> 00:18:17.660
What would you say
if I told you

152
00:18:17.743 --> 00:18:20.621
