153
00:18:20.705 --> 00:18:22.957
I'd say maybe
you're still asleep.

154
00:18:28.504 --> 00:18:31.924
You can live a whole lifetime
without ever being awake.

155
00:18:33.176 --> 00:18:34.510
Hey, Socrates.

156
00:18:36.095 --> 00:18:37.889
If you know so much,

157
00:18:39.056 --> 00:18:41.559
how come you're working
