This is a service station.
We offer service.

159
00:18:46.439 --> 00:18:48.441
There's no higher purpose.

160
00:18:49.358 --> 00:18:52.403
Than pumping gas?
Service to others.

161
00:18:57.033 --> 00:18:58.826
